WEBVTT

00:11:59.781 --> 00:12:04.466
and get, in exchange, real bananas
which I can actually eat.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:06.591
This is something amazing.

00:12:06.615 --> 00:12:08.693
You could never do it with chimpanzees.

00:12:08.717 --> 00:12:10.662
Chimpanzees trade, of course:

00:12:10.686 --> 00:12:13.436
"Yes, you give me a coconut,
I'll give you a banana."

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.698
That can work.

00:12:14.722 --> 00:12:17.714
But, you give me
a worthless piece of paper

00:12:17.738 --> 00:12:19.752
and you except me to give you a banana?

00:12:19.776 --> 00:12:20.928
No way!

00:12:20.952 --> 00:12:22.533
What do you think I am, a human?

00:12:22.557 --> 00:12:24.930
(Laughter)

00:12:24.954 --> 00:12:29.073
Money, in fact, is
the most successful story

00:12:29.097 --> 00:12:31.753
ever invented and told by humans,